          "processing": "Reads the agent from the cm (organization scope of the company admin). Resolves the responsible person reference to the organization user's name, status and login e-mail (login e-mail and status are derived, read from the platform, never stored here). Returns the cm limits as listed, in cm order. Only readable names are returned for display (noTechnicalIdsOnScreen); the responsible reference is kept only as the value to save."
